@startuml
skinparam shadowing true
actor User
participant Web
database DB
collections Cache
queue Jobs
box "Backend"
participant API
end box
User -> Web : open
activate Web
Web -> API : call
activate API
API -> DB : query
API -> Cache : read
API ->> Jobs : enqueue
note right of API : cached
API --> Web : data
deactivate API
ref over Web, API : login
alt ok
Web --> User : page
else error
Web --> User : oops
end
